esentative definitions include education and outside work experience</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Employee Profile</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="AccrualCalculationBase" EntityType="SFOData.AccrualCalculationBase" sap:label="Accrual Calculation Base" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>AccrualCalculationBase</Summary><LongDescription>Contains information about a calculation base. The base can be associated with individual cost elements, cost intervals etc.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="ThemeInfo" EntityType="SFOData.ThemeInfo" sap:label="ThemeInfo" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>ThemeInfo</Summary><LongDescription>Contains key UI properties for the current theme. This includes public css, URL, and accessibility preferences.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - User Interface Themes</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormSignatureSection" EntityType="SFOData.FormSignatureSection" sap:label="FormSignatureSection" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormSignatureSection</Summary><LongDescription>Contains basic information of signature section associated with the form.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="RBPRule" EntityType="SFOData.RBPRule" sap:label="RBPRule" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>RBPRule</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents rules in the Role Based Permissions system. You can use this entity to query the list of rules for a given role or to list rules across all roles. You can use this entity to insert a new rule or update an existing role</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Role Based Permissions</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="CurrencyExchangeRate" EntityType="SFOData.CurrencyExchangeRate" sap:label="Currency Exchange Rate" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>The Currency Exchange Rate</Summary><LongDescription>The entity CurrencyExchangeRate is created to provide information about Currency Conversions in EC. An exchange rate is how much it costs to exchange one source currency for another target currency</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkScheduleDay" EntityType="SFOData.WorkScheduleDay" sap:label="Work Schedule Day" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>WorkScheduleDay</Summary><LongDescription>Work schedule day defines the working time on a day. This entity is only used for work schedule of type SIMPLE.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Background_OutsideWorkExperience" EntityType="SFOData.Background_OutsideWorkExperience" sap:label="Background_OutsideWorkExperience" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Background*</Summary><LongDescription>Background o