ode</Summary><LongDescription>This is a foundation object that contains job codes for all job types.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Foundation/Organization</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="RelevantIndustryEntity" EntityType="SFOData.RelevantIndustryEntity" sap:label="Relevant Industry" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkflowAllowedActionList" EntityType="SFOData.WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:label="WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>WorkflowAllowedActionList</Summary><LongDescription>Contains the list of workflow actions that the given employee is allowed based on their role.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Workflow</sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Position" EntityType="SFOData.Position" sap:label="Position" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Position</Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Position Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobReqTemplate_Standard_Requisition" EntityType="SFOData.JobReqTemplate_Standard_Requisition" sap:label="JobReqTemplate_Standard_Requisition" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormCustomSection" EntityType="SFOData.FormCustomSection" sap:label="FormCustomSection" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormCustomSection</Summary><LongDescription>It contains Custom Section details for a form</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FamilyEntity" EntityType="SFOData.FamilyEntity" sap:label="Family" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>FamilyEntity</Summary><LongDescription>Contains primary classification of a job, which is also known as job family.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PaymentInformationDetailV3" EntityType="SFOData.PaymentInformationDetailV3" sap:label="Payment Information Detail" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>PaymentInformationDetailV3</Summary><LongDescription>The MDF entity PaymentInformationDetailV3 &lt;country code&gt; are child objects of PaymentInformationV3. Each of these objects stores the country-dependent fields of payment information details for a specific country. The relevant country is indicated by a three-digit ISO code.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payment Information</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection