Description><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payroll Time Sheets</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobClassificationFRA" EntityType="SFOData.JobClassificationFRA" sap:label="Job Classification France" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>JobClassificationFRA</Summary><LongDescription>This is a foundation object that provides France-specific information for a job classification.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Foundation/Organization</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormObjectiveOtherDetailsItem" EntityType="SFOData.FormObjectiveOtherDetailsItem" sap:label="FormObjectiveOtherDetailsItem" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormObjectiveOtherDetailsItem</Summary><LongDescription>The extended details information item for objectives, could be one of tasks, milestones, targets or metric lookup table. The data of other details item is in table format. The data for this entity comes from form content XML.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="BudgetGroup" EntityType="SFOData.BudgetGroup" sap:label="BudgetGroup" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>BudgetGroup</Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Foundation/Organization</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PerNationalId" EntityType="SFOData.PerNationalId" sap:label="National ID 