/sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="DevGoalCompetency" EntityType="SFOData.DevGoalCompetency" sap:label="DevGoalCompetency" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Goal Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PaymentMethodAssignmentV3" EntityType="SFOData.PaymentMethodAssignmentV3" sap:label="Payment Method Assignment" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payment Information</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormObjectiveDetails" EntityType="SFOData.FormObjectiveDetails" sap:label="FormObjectiveDetails" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormObjectiveDetails</Summary><LongDescription>The information for customized info of objectives. The data for this entity comes from form content XML. Type 0 - objective details, excluding tables; 1 - tasks; 2 - milestones; 3 - targets; 4 - metric lookup table</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobApplicationSnapshot_OutsideWorkExperience" EntityType="SFOData.JobApplicationSnapshot_OutsideWorkExperience" sap:label="JobApplicationSnapshot_OutsideWorkExperience" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Candidate Background</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the background elements as defined in the candidate template. For example:CandidateBackground_Certificate, CandidateBackground_Education, etc</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Candidate</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormItemConfiguration" EntityType="SFOData.FormItemConfiguration" sap:label="FormItemConfiguration" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormItemConfiguration</Summary><LongDescription>Contains configuration details associated with the objective or competency items</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WfRequestStep" EntityType="SFOData.WfRequestStep" sap:label="WfRequestStep" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>WfRequestStep</Summary><LongDescription>Contains information about a specific workflow step.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Workflow</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Background_LeadExperience" EntityType="SFOData.Background_LeadExperience" sap:label="Background_LeadExperience" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Background*</Summary><LongDescription>Background objects are customizable to store general background information about an employee. Representative definitions include education and outside work experience</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Employee Profile</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FeedbackFlag" EntityType="SFOData.FeedbackFlag" sap:label="Feedback Flag" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobReqQuestion" EntityType="SFOData.JobReqQuestion" sap:label="JobReqQuestion" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Questions</Summary><LongDescription>Allow to populate questions on Job Requisition using questionId</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormRouteStep" EntityType="SFOData.FormRouteStep" sap:label="FormRouteStep" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormRouteStep</Summary><LongDescription>It contains Route Map Step details for a form</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="OnboardingEquipmentType" EntityType="SFOData.OnboardingEquipmentType" sap:label="Onboarding Equipment Type" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription>The OnboardingEquipmentType is used as equipment category that can be selected in the equipment activity in Onboarding New Hire Activities.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Onboarding (ONB)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="DataReplicationProxy" EntityType="SFOData.DataReplicationProxy" sap:label="Data Replication Proxy" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>DataReplicationProxy</Summary><LongDescription>Contains a reference to an Employee Time Valuation Result that is replicated in other SAP systems. It filters the data already in the Employee Central system thus avoiding the necessity of a complex preselection in the middleware, later on.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payroll Time Sheets</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobApplicationOnboardingStatus" EntityType="SFOData.JobApplicationOnboardingStatus" sap:label="JobApplicationOnboardingStatus" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Application Onboarding Status</Summary><LongDescription>The JobApplicationOnboardingStatus entity represents the Onboarding portlet of a job application.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Application</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="EMEvent" EntityType="SFOData.EMEvent" sap:label="EMEvent" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Execution Manager</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="HolidayCalendar" EntityType="SFOData.HolidayCalendar" sap:label="Holiday Calendar" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>HolidayCalendar</Summary><LongDescription>A holiday calendar defines all relevant public holidays for an employee. Each holiday needs to be created separately in the Admin Tools by choosing Manage Time Off Structures. Afterwards, the holiday can be used for all relevant dates - for example, in the case of Christmas Day, December 25 2014, 2015, 2016, and so on. For each holiday, you can define whether it is a full holiday, half-holiday, or a normal working day at your business.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PersonType" EntityType="SFOData.PersonType" sap:label="PersonType" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>PersonType</Summary><LongDescription>PersonType specifies the type of person.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Suite (STE)</sap:tag><sap:tag>STE - ONBSimplify</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="DevGoalAchievements" EntityType="SFOData.DevGoalAchievements" sap:label="DevGoalAchievements" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>SuccessLine's GoalAchievements entity</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents Development Goals/Objective linked with Achievments.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FormReviewInfoSection" EntityType="SFOData.FormReviewInfoSection" sap:label="FormReviewInfoSection" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FormReviewInfoSection</Summary><LongDescription>Contains originator, start/end/due date of review form</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkScheduleDayModel" EntityType="SFOData.WorkScheduleDayModel" sap:label="Work Schedule Day Model" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>WorkScheduleDayModel</Summary><LongDescription>With a work schedule day model, you can define how the number of hours worked on a particular day should look. You can then use the day models in your work schedule if you choose the Period or Schedule models in your work schedule.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Bank" EntityType="SFOData.Bank" sap:label="Bank" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>BankDirectoryInformation</Summary><LongDescription>Contains Bank related information like Bank name ,Routing number , BIC and address details of the bank.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payment Information</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobProfile" EntityType="SFOData.JobProfile" sap:label="Job Profile" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>JobProfile</Summary><LongDescription>Contains detailed profiling information of a job. It inherits all of the competency and skill information from a job role and describes additional job information, such as education, certification, and physical requirements.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Form360SummaryViewRater" EntityType="SFOData.Form360SummaryViewRater" sap:label="Form360SummaryViewRater" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Form360SummaryViewRater</Summary><LongDescription>The form rater in the summary view section for 360 review form</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>MTR - MultiRater Review</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PaymentInformationDetailV3ZAF" EntityType="SFOData.PaymentInformationDetailV3ZAF" sap:label="Payment Information Detail ZAF" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>PaymentInformationDetailV3ZAF</Summary><LongDescription>Child object of PaymentInformationV3. Stores the country-dependent fields of payment information details for ZAF.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payment Information</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Background_Languages" EntityType="SFOData.Background_Languages" sap:label="Background_Languages" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Background*</Summary><LongDescription>Background objects are customizable to store general background information about an employee. Representative definitions include education and outside work experience</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Employee Profile</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobApplicationBackgroundCheckResult" EntityType="SFOData.JobApplicationBackgroundCheckResult" sap:label="JobApplicationBackgroundCheckResult" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>JobApplicationBackgroundCheckResult</Summary><LongDescription>The Job application background check result represents information regarding results of candidate background checks</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Application</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Docum