s, milestones, targets and metric lookup table. The data for this entity comes from form content XML.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM - Forms Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="GoalAchievementsList" EntityType="SFOData.GoalAchievementsList" sap:label="GoalAchievementsList" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>SuccessLine's Achievements entity</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents Achievements grouped by Goals.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Performance and Goals (PM/GM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PM/GM - Continuous Performance Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Background_PreferredNextMove" EntityType="SFOData.Background_PreferredNextMove" sap:label="Background_PreferredNextMove" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Background*</Summary><LongDescription>Background objects are customizable to store general background information about an employee. Representative definitions include education and outside work experience</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Employee Profile</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="EmpCompensationGroupSumCalculated" EntityType="SFOData.EmpCompensationGroupSumCalculated" sap:label="EmpCompensationGroupSumCalculated" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>EmpCompensationGroupSumCalculated</Summary><LongDescription>Calculated pay component group sum for compensation information</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Compensation Information</sap:tag><s