llection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PayCalendar" EntityType="SFOData.PayCalendar" sap:label="Pay Calendar" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>PayCalendar</Summary><LongDescription>This is a foundation object that describes a pay calendar for a particular pay group. This means it is the collection of all pay periods referring to the same pay group.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Foundation/Organization</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="TimeType" EntityType="SFOData.TimeType" sap:label="Time Type" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>TimeType</Summary><LongDescription>Contains the time type definition.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Background_SpecialAssign" EntityType="SFOData.Background_SpecialAssign" sap:label="Background_SpecialAssign" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Background*</Summary><LongDescription>Background objects are customizable to store general background information about an employee. Representative definitions include education and outside work experience</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Employee Profile</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="FOWfConfig" EntityType="SFOData.FOWfConfig" sap:label="Workflow" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>FOWfConfig</Summary><LongDescription>This is a foundation object that contains workflow configuration information</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Ce